updownio (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Isolate service clients and validate configuration.
  * Fix arrays, nested headers, empty responses and URL-based lookups.
  * Preserve caller data, prevent credential forwarding on redirects.
  * Add offline regression tests, CI, automatic tags and PyPI publishing.
  * Repair source distributions and document Python 3.10+ support.

